  "summary": "The page details the stochastic dynamics of epithelial sheet models for influenza, focusing on infection, death, and recovery rates. It includes diffusion coefficients for extracellular virus and cytokines, and chemotaxis parameters for immune cells. Adhesion parameters are specified for immune cell interactions, emphasizing preferential attachment to infected cells. The equations describe transition rates for infection and immune cell inflow and outflow, providing a comprehensive model of immune response dynamics."
